WEBVTT

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:07.580
In the near future, Doc Terror and his cyborg companion Hacker unleash their forces to conquer Earth.

00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:13.220
Only one force can stop this evil, a handful of brave men.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:21.540
In specially created exo-frames, they can be transported anywhere to fuse with incredible assault weapon systems,

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:29.430
beamed down from the space station Sky Vault, becoming man and machine power extreme.

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:33.460
Max Ray, brilliant sea operations commander.

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:41.320
Jake Rockwell, rugged land operations specialist.

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:46.840
Ace McLeod, daring air operations expert.

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:54.170
Whatever the challenge, they are ready.

00:00:54.590 --> 00:00:56.050
The Centurions!

00:01:20.120 --> 00:01:22.640
Terror's flunkies are here to steal the thermal energy.

00:01:23.530 --> 00:01:24.230
Assemble Cruiser.

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:28.490
Assemble and ready to be.

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:30.760
Energize.

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:33.100
Power Extreme!

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:16.410
High night's ready.

00:02:17.690 --> 00:02:19.510
I hope we can say the same for Ace.

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:25.770
Ready as I'll ever be, pretty lady.

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:28.580
Compliments will get you anywhere.

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:34.460
Energize.

00:02:42.280 --> 00:02:42.900
Opinion.

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:44.820
Problem with the beaming transmitter.

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:46.220
Energize.

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:37.100
Component defective.

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:38.220
Checking inventory.

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:40.390
No replacement on board.

00:03:41.840 --> 00:03:43.000
We'll get right on it.

00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:43.930
Good.

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:46.850
No assault weapons will be available until it's installed.

00:03:52.130 --> 00:03:52.970
Shootin', cowboy.

00:03:53.770 --> 00:03:57.110
With this baby, I could hit a needle in the haystack.

00:03:57.350 --> 00:03:59.970
I hate to interrupt your fun, fellas, but I...

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:01.700
I need you to do a little shopping.

00:04:15.410 --> 00:04:16.430
Do you like it?

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:20.020
It looks pale indeed next to your lovely eyes.

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:27.060
Why, thank you. Nothing today. I'm late for a luncheon engagement. Would you care to join me?

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:29.900
I'd love to, but I have an important appointment.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.000
Allow me to escort you to the lift.

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:36.620
I'd like to buy one of those 500-karat beryllium crystals.

00:04:40.260 --> 00:04:43.360
I'm afraid I can't help you. I sold all I had yesterday.

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:47.580
Well, suppose you tell me who bought them so I can get one from you.

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:52.360
Oh, I couldn't do that, sir. Our clientele is strictly confidential.

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:55.680
Look, fella, it's important I'd buy a crystal.

00:04:56.320 --> 00:04:58.180
It's out of the question, sir.

00:04:58.480 --> 00:04:59.600
That won't be necessary.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.700
Jake, I know who bought the crystals.

00:05:02.550 --> 00:05:03.230
Who was it?

00:05:03.940 --> 00:05:05.680
Star-Crossed Industries.

00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:08.120
Star-Crossed Industries?

00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:08.980
Wait a minute.

00:05:09.340 --> 00:05:10.160
Isn't that...

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:10.800
Right.

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:14.910
It's a purchasing company for our old friend, Doc Terror.

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:18.700
Crystals.

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:19.660
Checking outlets.

00:05:20.230 --> 00:05:21.570
No supplies available.

00:05:22.390 --> 00:05:25.090
It seems our friends have beaten us to it.

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:26.680
Checking for source.

00:05:27.600 --> 00:05:29.980
Located only terrestrial source.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:37.020
Of course, Kanchung region of Tibet. Mine not currently producing due to political unrest.

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:42.060
It looks as if your shopping trip will take a bit longer than I expected.

00:05:42.520 --> 00:05:46.280
That's okay with me. I had a yen for Chinese food anyway.

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:52.680
Remember, keep a low profile. There can't be any support from Sky Vault until we get the new crystal.

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:55.950
Don't worry, Max. I'll keep Jake out of trouble.

00:06:10.530 --> 00:06:18.430
our families are hungry must be allowed to return to work has been forbidden by the holy lama

00:06:18.430 --> 00:06:25.320
looks like we landed smack in the middle of a range war the mine entrance is over there let's roll

00:06:42.410 --> 00:06:43.810
This baby ought to do the trick.

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:47.070
Now all we need is a crystal detector to show me where to dig.

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:49.460
There might be one right here.

00:06:49.850 --> 00:06:51.510
I command you to stop!

00:06:57.430 --> 00:06:58.050
You are outsiders.

00:06:58.470 --> 00:06:59.970
Forgive me for startling you.

00:07:00.220 --> 00:07:02.080
I took you for defiant miners.

00:07:02.840 --> 00:07:04.560
With all due respect, sir,

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:06.960
we have urgent need of a crystal from this mine.

00:07:07.340 --> 00:07:09.140
This mountain is sacred.

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:11.720
No further disturbance can be tolerated.

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:15.540
I am sorry, but you must leave immediately.

00:07:17.140 --> 00:07:21.020
Come on, Jake.

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:22.980
We'd better do as he says.

00:07:24.860 --> 00:07:29.890
Okay, partner.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:36.870
what's your plan simple we'll head for that door head slam it then come back and get what we came

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:43.660
for I knew you'd have something up your shifty sleeve well I hate to be tricky but Max did

00:07:43.660 --> 00:07:45.060
tell us not to rock the boat

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:22.540
cowboy i knew there was something fishy about that guy he set us up all right let's get that crystal

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:24.760
the sooner we're out of here the better

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:49.470
established we have all the crystals yet we have had unexpected visitors two men wearing strange

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:58.970
metal suits centurions destroy them they have been crushed beneath the sphere of heaven good

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:04.640
Double production. Nothing shall interfere with my plan.

00:09:09.240 --> 00:09:10.990
Checkmate. Another game.

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:14.720
Oh, I can't concentrate. Maybe they've called in.

00:09:19.980 --> 00:09:21.660
Any message from McLeod or Rockwell?

00:09:22.310 --> 00:09:22.730
Negative.

00:09:25.240 --> 00:09:26.260
Max calling Sky Vault.

00:09:28.120 --> 00:09:29.420
Crystal, any progress?

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:34.640
Affirmative. My calculations show that synthesis of the crystal is possible.

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:39.040
Good. Send the formula to C-Lab. I'll beam there and supervise.

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:43.360
Destination C-Lab. Debate.

00:09:43.840 --> 00:09:56.540
We're getting warmer, but not warming up.

00:09:57.000 --> 00:09:58.280
This area's played out.

00:09:58.940 --> 00:09:59.920
So, where to?

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:11.850
next let away the vein is down there all right and someone is working let's step on it then we

00:10:11.850 --> 00:10:13.110
wouldn't want to be late for work

00:10:31.120 --> 00:10:33.700
Bingo! We found the motherlode!

00:10:34.350 --> 00:10:36.170
I'll slip in and grab a crystal.

00:10:36.470 --> 00:10:38.830
Get us beamed out of here as soon as I've got it.

00:10:48.760 --> 00:10:51.860
Sneaking apples from Mr. Wilson's fortune when we were kids.

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:55.740
What is this?

00:10:57.520 --> 00:10:59.960
Oh, they have survived, but not a...

00:11:05.050 --> 00:11:06.450
Let's hardtail it out of here.

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:08.460
Ake's calling Centrum.

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:10.200
Centrum, do you read me?

00:11:11.360 --> 00:11:12.540
Gate, behind you!

00:11:24.140 --> 00:11:26.270
Centrum, the tunnel with the crystal.

00:11:26.550 --> 00:11:27.510
I'll run interference.

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:49.600
Second, now they can dig that.

00:11:51.650 --> 00:11:52.950
Next stop, daylight.

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:00.920
Thanks, Lucy.

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:06.380
Yes, it's better.

00:12:06.640 --> 00:12:08.120
The burn circuits are fixed,

00:12:08.260 --> 00:12:10.100
but until we get the crystal, it won't work.

00:12:13.430 --> 00:12:15.410
Well, hello, sunshine.

00:12:18.390 --> 00:12:20.710
You have defiled the secret mountain.

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:22.250
Seize them!

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:29.690
And we'll lose them in the temple.

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:33.260
Roger. Fire till you see the lights of their screens.

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:35.880
Easy come, easy go.

00:13:01.920 --> 00:13:28.970
That's a dandy of a drop. Yeah, mom's must have exposed an old mine. I'm tired of running. Let's get some hardware

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:32.420
Good idea! Ace to Centrum!

00:13:34.520 --> 00:13:36.880
...must have the whole mountain under a force field!

00:13:37.860 --> 00:13:40.030
Look at this! Open it!

00:13:43.910 --> 00:13:47.520
Thank you, my friends. I had been in there a long time.

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:59.980
I've met the imposter. He appeared one...

00:14:00.510 --> 00:14:09.860
As I was meditating, he quickly overpowered the temple guard.

00:14:12.840 --> 00:14:18.080
He then brought me to this cell where I have remained in prison until you released me.

00:14:18.900 --> 00:14:20.360
How may I serve you?

00:14:20.780 --> 00:14:23.320
We've got to get to the surface to contact our headquarters.

00:14:24.080 --> 00:14:26.380
There is a passageway to the temple. Come.

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:29.980
Use a dead crystal at the ground, boy.

00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:31.690
for the temple?

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:33.030
That is correct.

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:35.590
They were outside the force field,

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:38.410
yet no assault weapons materialized?

00:14:39.160 --> 00:14:39.560
None.

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:44.950
Sit bro, and they need Chris to fix it.

00:14:45.810 --> 00:14:52.210
They're not to come on.

00:14:58.970 --> 00:14:59.350
The synthesis.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:01.690
Third attempt, begin.

00:15:02.440 --> 00:15:04.180
Heat and pressure to maximum.

00:15:05.470 --> 00:15:06.370
Cycle completed.

00:15:07.100 --> 00:15:07.500
Cooling.

00:15:09.160 --> 00:15:10.500
Computer analysis.

00:15:11.500 --> 00:15:12.720
Insufficient pressure.

00:15:15.740 --> 00:15:16.220
It's it.

00:15:16.700 --> 00:15:17.440
Depth pressure.

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:24.680
Destination Marianas Trench and step on it.

00:15:39.400 --> 00:15:42.360
Six miles of water for pressure and a volcano for heat.

00:15:42.860 --> 00:15:43.720
This should do it.

00:15:55.110 --> 00:15:56.990
Dissentrum, beam me in.

00:16:05.240 --> 00:16:06.060
The floor.

00:16:25.180 --> 00:16:27.480
Send us artillery and back.

00:16:31.820 --> 00:16:32.680
Run for the temple.

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:38.330
To the temple.

00:16:47.260 --> 00:16:48.340
Get us out of here.

00:16:50.120 --> 00:16:53.740
Computer verified that this beam is only good for one more transmission.

00:16:54.330 --> 00:16:57.110
I made a crystal with a flaw, but it might work.

00:16:57.930 --> 00:16:59.490
Get that baby to Sky Vault.

00:16:59.690 --> 00:16:59.970
We'll...

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:25.140
hold them off till the cavalry arrives i've been listening in ready to receive transmission

00:17:38.670 --> 00:17:40.930
I can't play spaceball right now, Lucy.

00:17:42.760 --> 00:17:43.640
Oh, all right.

00:17:44.100 --> 00:17:45.260
Let's have a fastball.

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:07.260
Skybolt to Ace and Jake.

00:18:08.050 --> 00:18:11.630
Prepare for Skybolt and Detonator Assault Weapon Systems transmission.

00:18:13.260 --> 00:18:13.980
Energize!

00:18:14.560 --> 00:18:16.660
Danger. Power overloading.

00:18:18.970 --> 00:18:19.690
Energize!

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:03.870
A perfect set up for the Death Spiral!

00:19:05.100 --> 00:19:10.980
Here we go!

00:19:33.870 --> 00:19:55.060
area may have won the battle but you shall not savor the victory why don't you pick on someone

00:19:55.060 --> 00:19:56.140
your own size

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:02.000
Doggone if he wasn't an android.

00:20:02.380 --> 00:20:04.240
Something was fishy about him, all right.

00:20:06.270 --> 00:20:10.320
Without your help, our 3,000-year-old culture would have vanished.

00:20:11.240 --> 00:20:13.740
We have prepared a small gift for you.

00:20:18.200 --> 00:20:21.680
Please accept our token of everlasting gratitude.

00:20:22.630 --> 00:20:28.590
Your generous gift will ensure our ability to combat the forces of evil for centuries to come.

00:20:35.020 --> 00:20:36.640
Right, Lucy. Spaceballs.

00:20:36.940 --> 00:20:37.920
We'll play soon.

00:21:00.060 --> 00:21:00.200
Thank you.
